      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/lakeside_woods_connecticut",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The construction of Candlewood Lake in 1928 flooded surrounding farmland, reshaping the region and giving Lakeside Woods its current lakeside character.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        27,
        28,
